        <helo1:HELO_9000010 xml:lang="en">Review B of HELO 0.2.0 (19 October 2026) proposes that Measuring Health Gain is also for the health economist, for Darrin Baines to confirm. The site does not state who the pathway is for. The HETO route, through the practitioner roles of the tasks the pathway is proposed to prepare for, gives the same profile.</helo1:HELO_9000010>
