        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Setting the Rules of Access</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/knowledge-map/health-policy"/>
        <helo1:HELO_9000002 xml:lang="en">How to get a medicine to patients by following it through approval and pricing</helo1:HELO_9000002>
        <helo1:HELO_9000003 xml:lang="en">Do you want to learn how public bodies decide which medicines and prevention measures reach people, and at what price? You follow a new medicine through approval and pricing, then learn how to measure whether the gains from health policy reach the people who need them most.</helo1:HELO_9000003>
