        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Clinical and patient-reported outcomes in Measuring Health Gain</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">What a study measures about how patients feel, function and survive, and who does the reporting.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">Every utility, QALY or money value starts from an outcome someone measured, so the pathway begins with what is measured and who reports the outcome.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo/HELO_6000005 -->

