        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cost-effectiveness analysis in Judging Value for Money</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">Weighing the extra cost of an option against the extra health the option brings, and deciding whether that is worth paying for.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">With costs and outcomes in present values, the next question is whether the extra health an option brings is worth its extra cost.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo/HELO_6000011 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo/HELO_6000011">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo/HELO_0000002"/>
        <helo1:HELO_1000002 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo/HELO_5000003"/>
