        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Disease-area economics in Judging Value for Money</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">How the same methods are applied in particular clinical areas. Pick the ones that match your work.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">With the general methods in place, these show how each clinical area applies them to its own data and decisions.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


