        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Model inputs and parameters in Building the Model</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">Where the numbers in a model come from, and how rates, probabilities and life tables are turned into the values a model needs.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">With the main structures in place, the next task is filling them with probabilities and other values drawn from the evidence.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


