        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Uncertainty and sensitivity analysis in Building the Model</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">Testing how much the results change when inputs or assumptions change, one at a time or all together through simulation.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">Every input carries some uncertainty, so after validation the model is run again across plausible values to see how stable its answer is.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


