        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Value of information in Building the Model</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">Putting a money value on reducing uncertainty, to show whether further research is worth paying for.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">Value of information builds on the simulation results of probabilistic sensitivity analysis, so it follows the uncertainty step.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/helo/HELO_6000028 -->

