        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">How trials and observational studies are set up so that treatments can be compared fairly.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">Every treatment effect used in an evaluation comes from a study, so the pathway starts with how studies are designed and where bias can enter.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


