        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Statistical methods in Weighing the Evidence</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">The tools for estimating effects from study data and for showing how uncertain those estimates are.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">With the measures defined, statistical methods show how each one is estimated from data and how far the estimate can be trusted.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


