        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Causal inference and real-world evidence in Weighing the Evidence</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">Estimating treatment effects from routine data and other non-randomised sources, where the groups being compared may differ at the start.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">Trials cannot answer every question, so the pathway ends with methods that adjust for differences between groups when there is no randomisation.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


