        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Health financing and insurance in Follow the Money</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">How a system raises money for health and pools it so that people share the risk of high care costs, through taxes or insurance.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">Once the structure is clear, the next question is where the money comes from and how pooling protects people against the cost of illness.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


