        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Provider payment in Follow the Money</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">How purchasers pay doctors and hospitals, and the incentives that each payment method creates for the amount and kind of care given.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">With pooled funds in place, the next step is how purchasers spend those funds by paying the providers who deliver care.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


