        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Provider finance in Follow the Money</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">How hospitals and other providers plan budgets and read financial ratios to check whether they can pay their bills and stay solvent.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">The way a provider is paid shapes its income, so its budgets and financial health are looked at next.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


