        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Drug development and regulation in Setting the Rules of Access</rdfs:label>
        <helo1:HELO_9000004 xml:lang="en">How a new medicine gains approval and how its safety is watched once patients use it, including faster routes for serious conditions.</helo1:HELO_9000004>
        <helo1:HELO_9000005 xml:lang="en">The pathway starts with drug development and regulation, because a medicine must be approved before anyone can set its price or judge its value.</helo1:HELO_9000005>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


